{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42814","headline":"偶闻官吏举请辄有一篇寄从弟舍人 · 刘兼","name":"偶闻官吏举请辄有一篇寄从弟舍人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官吏潜陈借寇词，宦情乡梦两相违。\n青城锦水无心住，紫阁莲峯有意归。\n张翰鲈鱼因醉忆，孟光书信近春稀。\n黄茅瘴色看看起，贪者犹疑别是机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}